      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start and a solid professional tone. \n\nHowever, the relevance score came back a bit lower than our usual threshold for these reports (it's at 3). For the next version, can you expand on the defensive positioning aspect and maybe add a bit more depth to the section on interest rates?\n\nTry to weave those key themes (growth, yield, diversification, portfolio) in more naturally so the score is higher, but seriously—don't make it look like you're just dumping the words in. It needs to still read like a high-end briefing, not a marketing brochure. Goal is to get that score up towards 10-12 without losing the professional substance.",
